Package: ha-hypervisor-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: franekSoftSF <franekSoftSF@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates
Recommends: systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/franekSoftSF/HA-Hypervisor
Description: Agent connecting hypervisors and server BMCs to Home Assistant
 Runs outside the managed cluster and talks to Home Assistant over MQTT.
 Collects statistics, controls virtual machines, and shuts down and powers on
 whole clusters through vCenter, ESXi and the server BMC.
 .
 Includes its own Python runtime in /opt/ha-hypervisor-agent.
